2026-06-28T10:40:04.610Z [DEBUG] Tool invocation result: [{"id":4825806524,"body":"### Servicing repro — `Math.Round(2.5)` midpoint rounding\n\n**Issue.** `Math.Round(double)` uses banker's rounding (`MidpointRounding.ToEven`) by default, so `Math.Round(2.5)` returns `2` instead of `3`. Customers porting from frameworks that round half away from zero get incorrect totals.\n\n**Repro approach.** Minimal **csproj console app** targeting `net9.0`. (The preferred xunit unit test can't restore packages offline in this environment, and a file-based `dotnet run app.cs` repro requires a .NET 10+ SDK.) Built and run on the **baseline GA .NET 9 SDK `9.0.315`** (runtime `9.0.17`), which still exhibits the bug.\n\n**Isolating call site** (`repro/Program.cs`):\n\n```csharp\ndouble input = 2.5;\ndouble expected = 3;                 // PR Expected Result: Math.Round(2.5) == 3\ndouble actual = Math.Round(input);   // isolated call site under test\n\nif (actual != expected)\n    Console.WriteLine($\"REPRO CONFIRMED: Math.Round({input}) returned {actual}, expected {expected}.\");\n```\n\n**Expected Result.** `Math.Round(2.5)` returns `3`.\n\n**Actual Result** (quoted from the captured `output.log`):\n\n```\n=== dotnet run ===\nCall:     Math.Round(2.5)\nExpected: 3\nActual:   2\nREPRO CONFIRMED: Math.Round(2.5) returned 2, expected 3.\nexit=1\n```\n\nThe bug **reproduces**: `Math.Round(2.5)` yields `2` on the baseline GA .NET 9 SDK instead of the expected `3`.\n\n**Artifact.** The repro sources + `output.log` are uploaded as artifact **`servicing-repro-pr-1`** on this workflow run: https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/actions/runs/28318977468\n\n\n\n> Generated by [Servicing Repro Producer](https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/actions/runs/28318977468) · 251.1 AIC · ⊞ 6.8K · [◷](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Ajeffhandley%2Fdotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager+%22gh-aw-workflow-call-id%3A+jeffhandley%2Fdotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager%2Fservicing-repro-producer%22&type=issues)\n\n<!-- gh-aw-agentic-workflow: Servicing Repro Producer, engine: copilot, version: 1.0.63, model: claude-opus-4.8, id: 28318977468, workflow_id: servicing-repro-producer, run: https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/actions/runs/28318977468 -->\n<!-- gh-aw-workflow-call-id: jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/servicing-repro-producer -->","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/pull/1#issuecomment-4825806524","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"profile_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4"},"author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"created_at":"2026-06-28T10:29:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T10:29:45Z"}]
